ary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q8IWU5","text":"Exhibits arylsulfatase activity and highly specific endoglucosamine-6-sulfatase activity (PubMed:12368295, PubMed:30788513, PubMed:35294879). It can remove sulfate from the C-6 position of glucosamine within specific subregions of intact heparin (PubMed:12368295, PubMed:30788513, PubMed:35294879)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}